SOAPBOX: Nice job by the organizers on the inaugural WW DIGI test.
SOAPBOX: I thought there would be a lot more stations on the air,
SOAPBOX: but I had a good time. Some kinks to work out, I think
SOAPBOX: on the exchages / software side.
SOAPBOX: Took a break to go watch Star Wars: The Empire Strikes
SOAPBOX: Back with the Cleveland Orchestra playing the score
SOAPBOX: with my harmonics, and to sleep. Spent more time in
SOAPBOX: the chair than I expected I'd be able to.
